WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.440
Thanks for calling Ace Dentists. I'm Liv. How can I help?

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:16.280
Hi, Liv. I need to book an appointment for my son. He's got a toothache he's been complaining

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:20.680
about and yeah, he just needs an appointment ASAP.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:28.040
Is your son experiencing any swelling, uncontrolled bleeding, trauma, or trouble breathing or

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:34.500
swallowing? No, none of that. Just that he's complaining about his toothache is causing him

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.000
a headache and things of that nature. I just want to get him checked out, make sure it's

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:44.440
nothing too serious. Got it. Is this your son's first visit with us or has he been to the

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:53.360
practice before? It would be his first time. Thanks. May I have your son's full name and

00:00:53.360 --> 00:01:04.160
the best phone number to reach you on? His name is Malachi. Malachi Adams.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:16.480
Thanks. And the best phone number to reach you on? That's [phone number hidden]. Do you have a preference

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:23.000
for a day or time for the appointment, morning, afternoon, or any time? I mean, it's pretty

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:35.200
bad he's been complaining. Is there any slots for today back in the evening maybe?

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:39.640
There are no regular appointment slots left today, but I do have some emergency slots tonight

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:47.160
with an emergency call out surcharge. I can offer 930, 10 in the evening or 1030. Does

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:54.760
any of those times work for you? Yeah, we can do 930. 930 works. Thanks. Is your email address

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:59.320
available or would you prefer not to provide it? I prefer not to provide it. I don't think

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:10.160
it's necessary. To confirm, I have booked a new urgent dental assessment appointment

00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:16.440
for Malachi Adams on Tuesday the 6th of October at 930 in the evening with the emergency call

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:26.440
out surcharge. The best number to reach you on is [phone number hidden]. Is that all correct?

00:02:26.440 --> 00:02:33.240
Yep, that's all right. Thank you. The appointment is all set for Tuesday the 6th of October

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:39.360
at 930 in the evening. The team has everything they need. Thanks for calling Ace Dentists

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:41.320
and I hope Malachi feels better soon.
